    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>ProyectoIN Zip Code Manager for Elementor is a specialized tool designed for digital marketing agencies and local businesses. It allows you to link WordPress pages or custom post types with specific zip codes.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>zip-code-manager</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Renamed plugin to ProyectoIN Zip Code Manager for Elementor as requested by reviewers.</li>\n<li>Fix: Declared compatibility with WordPress 6.9.</li>\n<li>Fix: Applied unique prefixes (proin_zcm_) to all functions and classes.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Link pages with zip codes and allow AJAX search via Elementor widget for better local SEO and service area mapping.",
